
<header class="bg-primary text-white text-center py-5">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">BillSplitter</h1>
    <p class="lead">The easiest way to split bills with friends and keep track of expenses.</p>
    <a href="<%= new_user_registration_path %>" class="btn btn-light btn-lg rounded-pill mt-3">
      Get Started <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="container my-5">
  <h2 class="text-center mb-4">Why Use BillSplitter?</h2>
  <div class="row text-center">
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 p-4">
        <i class="bi bi-cash-stack fs-1 text-primary"></i>
        <h4 class="mt-3">Track Expenses</h4>
        <p>Keep a detailed record of all shared expenses and personal contributions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 p-4">
        <i class="bi bi-people fs-1 text-success"></i>
        <h4 class="mt-3">Manage Groups</h4>
        <p>Organize expenses easily by creating groups for different events or trips.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 p-4">
        <i class="bi bi-wallet2 fs-1 text-danger"></i>
        <h4 class="mt-3">Simplified Settlements</h4>
        <p>Settle up in just a few clicks without any confusion over who owes what.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
